_62182f7fb428.wav", "Face your fears — they are rarely as big as they seem.": "s_c0426fe46f5d.wav", "In fact, learning a language takes years of daily practice.": "s_3f7b2eb932f8.wav", "I need to figure out the best solution to this problem.": "s_2d56f26bbf43.wav", "She finally finished writing her first novel at 58.": "s_8019ef083b29.wav", "Her passion for education fired up every student she met.": "s_ba3aa6edd4e4.wav", "She stays fit by cycling to work every single day.": "s_c406ad6753f9.wav", "She fixed the leaking pipe herself without calling a plumber.": "s_a8dfa43b6eb2.wav", "The office is on the 15th floor with an amazing view.": "s_53058270372c.wav", "Time flies when you are doing what you love.": "s_0644feaa2eae.wav", "Follow your dreams, but also follow through on your plans.": "s_eed8293ed725.wav", "Sometimes life forces you to change in ways you never expected.": "s_066eb0dd9a0f.wav", "Please fill in the form before your appointment.": "s_5bb8397c12e7.wav", "Moving forward is the only direction that makes sense.": "s_2e3882619d2d.wav", "A fresh perspective can solve problems you have been stuck on.": "s_4993c46b19de.wav", "You gain strength from every challenge you overcome.": "s_37ee425aacc6.wav", "Life is not a game — but it helps to play it strategically.": "s_e0c5ac9bf41f.wav", "She grew vegetables in her small garden all summer.": "s_f8728bc1ecc7.wav", "The family gathers every year for the New Year celebration.": "s_0c32075468e9.wav", "As a general rule, simpler is almost always better.": "s_db1d5074c03a.wav", "The greatest gift you can give someone is your full attention.": "s_2653864e9922.wav", "A good grade is a reflection of consistent hard work.": "s_3450b9de10d9.wav", "Strong relationships are built on common ground.": "s_607705784d66.wav", "group": "group.wav", "guess": "guess.wav", "guide": "guide.wav", "handle": "handle.wav", "hang": "hang.wav", "happen": "happen.wav", "health": "health.wav", "heart": "heart.wav", "hide": "hide.wav", "hig