ac1ab88cfd.wav", "Be patient with yourself — you are learning something hard.": "s_740bd1f9ad15.wav", "Done is better than perfect — start before you are ready.": "s_1302339c9c8b.wav", "Be the kind of person you needed when you were younger.": "s_c57a246e395d.wav", "She puts her phone away during every meal with her family.": "s_e03f13d81aa0.wav", "Look at the big picture before worrying about the small details.": "s_77fe1f84a3a9.wav", "A positive mind finds opportunities in every situation.": "s_18e5ca990dc7.wav", "Everything seems impossible until someone makes it possible.": "s_37f92f39e1a8.wav", "Be fully present — your full attention is the greatest gift.": "s_ecb79f8bdfc3.wav", "Everything has a price — including doing nothing at all.": "s_305ce5fc9102.wav", "When you produce good work consistently, opportunities follow.": "s_82f49c23612b.wav", "They climbed the hill to watch the sunset together.": "s_015b6a9eaf29.wav", "It is an honor to be trusted with such responsibility.": "s_ba68302e1e2a.wav", "Hope is not a strategy, but it is where every strategy begins.": "s_245e22bb277d.wav", "One focused hour is worth five distracted ones.": "s_474411847deb.wav", "A house is just a building — home is where love lives.": "s_f31af31f8524.wav", "Being human means being imperfect — and that is perfectly fine.": "s_729b3df56e95.wav", "It hurts more to regret the things you did not try.": "s_5ae688c5fe1d.wav", "The team includes people from seven different countries.": "s_431bf39b0e39.wav", "Regular practice will increase your vocabulary quickly.": "s_9be6c30bbc99.wav", "Every individual brings something unique to a team.": "s_d0c8792f3d39.wav", "The relationships that last are those built on honesty.": "s_db4bd978af39.wav", "Do it now — later becomes never more quickly than you think.": "s_e60c36d1b79c.wav", "Good characters in stories have many layers to discover.": "s_047cb7a87459.wav", "She still writes a handwritten letter to her mother every week.": "s_85bfa43208d3.wav", "Take your English to the next level with consistent practice.": "s_9fbfcd4a2b86.wav", "Be the light in someone's dark day — it costs nothing.": "s_2e0e9f058ea0.wav", "Success is more likely when you focus on one thing at a time.": "s_43a5b458cfdc.wav", "Push your limits a little further each week.": "s_a92e2ef0a02c.wav", "Everything is connected — every cause has a linked effect.": "s_7a43a9a07b76.wav", "Live fully today — not for yesterday or tomorrow.": "s_67955c81af40.wav", "She misses her hometown but loves where she is now.": "s_375cf399030d.wav", "Be fully present in this moment — it will not come again.": "s_3895d7c833b7.wav", "The first move is always the hardest — but you must make it.": "s_3469ad2577df.wav", "Learning feels more natural when you genuinely enjoy it.": "s_91dab38c3b0b.wav", "She offered to help without being asked — that is rare.": "s_be48c135254e.wav", "Your opinion only matters if you are willing to listen to others'.": "s_d6a84e30d52b.wav", "No pain, no gain — but choose your pain wisely.": "s_aa2c304b6d66.wav", "She published her first research paper at the age of twenty-two.": "s_c88f48b283f3.wav", "She clears her head by walking through the park every evening.": "s_214a208bd31b.wav", "Time passes quickly when you are doing meaningful work.": "s_4b7f5d861f2e.wav", "You do not need to prove yourself to everyone — just to yourself.": "s_804eba5f2985.wav", "Pull yourself together and face the challenge head-on.": "s_3ab4468e71ba.wav", "Push yourself a little beyond your comfort zone each day.": "s_48bafd9e6e07.wav", "It took her three years to reach the sales target she set for herself.": "s_ef6e98d778ad.wav", "The more you read, the more you see the world clearly.": "s_07ab0500bca7.wav", "Keep it real — authenticity is the most powerful communication tool.": "s_c83b9226ec20.wav", "The reason behind your goal determines how far you will go.": "s_4ea5b71e8585.wav", "Learning to receive help gracefully is as important as giving it.": "